# IntraCore: параметры HAL блока из базы STM32CubeMX (db/mcu/IP/*_Modes.xml).
# Порождено tools/hal_import — руками не править. Формат: src/Docs/Description/HalCatalogFormat.md
[Ip]
Name=GFXTIM
Version=v1_0_Cube

[Parameters]
# имя|подпись|группа|единица|мин|макс|описание
SynchroSrc|HSYNC and VSYNC sources|Source Selection||||Synchronization signals (HSYNC and VSYNC) sources. Note: This parameter can be a value.
TearingEffectActivation|Tearing effect (TE)|Source Selection||||Tearing effect . Activate it to specify the configuration details
TearingEffectSrc|Tearing effect source|Source Selection||||Tearing effect source. Note: This parameter can be a value.
TearingEffectPolarity|Tearing effect polarity|Source Selection||||Tearing effect polarity. Note: This parameter can be a value.
TearingEffectInterrupt|Tearing effect interrupt|Source Selection||||Tearing effect interrupt. Note: Useful only when Tearing effect interrupt parameter is enabled.
LineClockCounter|Line Clock Counter (LCC)|Clock Generator||||Clock Generator Activation. Activate it to specify the configuration details
LCCHwReloadSrc|LCC Auto-reload trigger|Clock Generator||||Line Clock Counter hardware reload source. Note: Useful only when Line Clock Counter hardware reload source parameter is enabled.
LCCReloadValue|LCC Auto-reload value|Clock Generator||0|4194303|Line Clock Counter reload value (22 bits). This parameter must be a number between Min_Data = 1 and Max_Data = 4194303.
LCCClockSrc|LCC clock source|Clock Generator||||Line Clock Counter Clock Source. Note: Useful only when Line Clock Counter Clock Source parameter is enabled.
FrameClockCounter|Frame Clock Counter (FCC)|Clock Generator||||Clock Generator Activation. Activate it to specify the configuration details
FCCHwReloadSrc|FCC Auto-reload trigger|Clock Generator||||Frame Clock Counter hardware reload source. Note: Useful only when Frame Clock Counter hardware reload source parameter is enabled.
FCCReloadValue|FCC Auto-reload value|Clock Generator||0|4095|Frame Clock Counter reload value (12 bits). This parameter must be a number between Min_Data = 1 and Max_Data = 4095.
FCCClockSrc|FCC clock source|Clock Generator||||Frame Clock Counter Clock Source. Note: Useful only when Frame Clock Counter Clock Source parameter is enabled.
LineClockSrc|Line Ck source|Clock Generator||||Line Clock Source. Note: Useful only when Line Clock Source parameter is enabled.
LineClockCalib|Line Ck output calibration|Clock Generator||||Debug purpose. Note: Useful only when Line Clock Calib parameter is enabled.
FrameClockSrc|Frame Ck source|Clock Generator||||Frame Clock Source. Note: Useful only when Frame Clock Source parameter is enabled.
FrameClockCalib|Frame Ck output calibration|Clock Generator||||Debug purpose. Note: Useful only when Frame Clock Calib parameter is enabled.
EventGenerator1|Event generator 1|Event Generators||||Event Generator 1. Note: Useful only when Event Generator 1 parameter is enabled.
EventInterrupt1|Event interrupt|Event Generators||||Event Interrupt 1. Note: Useful only when Event Interrupt 1 parameter is enabled.
FrameEvent1|Frame event|Event Generators||||Event Frame 1. Note: Useful only when Event Frame 1 parameter is enabled.
LineEvent1|Line event|Event Generators||||Event Line 1. Note: Useful only when Event Line 1 parameter is enabled.
EventGenerator2|Event generator 2|Event Generators||||Event generator 2. Note: Useful only when Event Generator 2 parameter is enabled.
EventInterrupt2|Event interrupt|Event Generators||||Event Interrupt 2. Note: Useful only when Event Interrupt 2 parameter is enabled.
FrameEvent2|Frame event|Event Generators||||Event Frame 2. Note: Useful only when Event Frame 2 parameter is enabled.
LineEvent2|Line event|Event Generators||||Event Line 2. Note: Useful only when Event Line 2 parameter is enabled.
EventGenerator3|Event generator 3|Event Generators||||Event Generator 3. Note: Useful only when Event Generator 3 parameter is enabled.
EventInterrupt3|Event interrupt|Event Generators||||Event Interrupt 3. Note: Useful only when Event Interrupt 3 parameter is enabled.
FrameEvent3|Frame event|Event Generators||||Event Frame 3. Note: Useful only when Event Frame 3 parameter is enabled.
LineEvent3|Line event|Event Generators||||Event Line 3. Note: Useful only when Event Line 3 parameter is enabled.
EventGenerator4|Event generator 4|Event Generators||||Event Generator 4. Note: Useful only when Event Generator 4 parameter is enabled.
EventInterrupt4|Event interrupt|Event Generators||||Event Interrupt 4. Note: Useful only when Event Interrupt 4 parameter is enabled.
FrameEvent4|Frame event|Event Generators||||Event Frame 4. Note: Useful only when Event Frame 4 parameter is enabled.
LineEvent4|Line event|Event Generators||||Event Line 4. Note: Useful only when Event Line 4 parameter is enabled.
AbsoluteTimerActivation|Absolute Timer Activation|Absolute Timer||||Absolute Timer Activation. Activate it to specify the configuration details
FrameCompare1Value|Absolute Frame Compare 1 value|Absolute Timer||0|1048575|Absolute Frame Compare 1 value (20 bits). This parameter must be a number between 1 and 1048575.
FrameCounterValue|Absolute Frame Counter value|Absolute Timer||0|1048575|Absolute Frame Counter initial value (20 bits). This parameter must be a number between 1 and 1048575.
FrameOverflowInterrupt|Absolute Frame Counter Overflow Interrupt|Absolute Timer||||Overflow Interrupt. Note: Useful only when Overflow Interrupt parameter is enabled.
FrameCompare1Interrupt|Absolute Frame Compare 1 Interrupt|Absolute Timer||||Frame Compare 1 Interrupt. Note: Useful only when Frame Compare 1 Interrupt parameter is enabled.
LineCompare1Value|Absolute Line Compare 1 value|Absolute Timer||0|4095|Absolute Line Compare 1. Note: Useful only when Absolute Line Compare 1 parameter is enabled.
LineCompare2Value|Absolute Line Compare 2 value|Absolute Timer||0|4095|Absolute Line Compare 2 value (12 bits). This parameter must be a number between 0 and 4095.
LineCounterValue|Absolute Line Counter value|Absolute Timer||0|4095|Absolute Line Counter value (12 bits). This parameter must be a number between 0 and 4095.
LineOverflowInterrupt|Absolute Line Counter Overflow Interrupt|Absolute Timer||||Line Overflow Interrupt. Note: Useful only when Line Overflow Interrupt parameter is enabled.
LineCompare1Interrupt|Absolute Line Compare 1 Interrupt|Absolute Timer||||Line Compare 1 Interrupt. Note: Useful only when Line Compare 1 Interrupt parameter is enabled.
LineCompare2Interrupt|Absolute Line Compare 2 Interrupt|Absolute Timer||||Line Compare 2 Interrupt. Note: Useful only when Line Compare 2 Interrupt parameter is enabled.
WatchdogTimer|Watchdog Timer|Watchdog||||Watchdog Activation. Activate it to specify the configuration details
ClockSrc|Counter clock source|Watchdog||||Clock Source. Note: Useful only when Clock Source parameter is enabled.
AutoReloadValue|Counter Auto-reload value|Watchdog||0|65535|Auto Reload value (16 bits). This parameter must be a number between 0 and 65535.
HwReloadConfig|Auto-reload trigger|Watchdog||||Reload Configuration. Note: Useful only when Reload Configuration parameter is enabled. The two values wrld rising edge and wrld falling edge not available on Viper64K-H7R.
PreAlarmValue|Pre-Alarm value|Watchdog||0|65535|Pre-alarm value (16 bits). This parameter must be a number between 0 and 65535.
AlarmInterrupt|Alarm interrupt|Watchdog||||Interrupt Alarm. Note: Useful only when Interrupt Alarm parameter is enabled.
PreAlarmInterrupt|Pre-Alarm interrupt|Watchdog||||Interrupt Pre-alarm. Note: Useful only when Interrupt Pre-Alarm parameter is enabled.
RelativeTimerActivation|Relative timer activation|Relative timer||||Relative Timer Activation. Activate it to specify the configuration details
RelativeTimer1|Relative Timer 1|Relative Timers||||Relative Timer 1 Note: Useful only when Relative Timer 1 parameter is enabled.
AutoReloadValue1|Auto reload value|Relative Timers||0|4095|Auto reload value 1 (12 bits). This parameter must be a number between 0 and 4095.
CounterMode1|Counter mode|Relative Timers||||Counter Mode 1. Note: Useful only when Counter Mode 1 parameter is enabled.
ReloadInterrupt1|Reload interrupt|Relative Timers||||Reload Interrupt 1. Note: Useful only when Reload Interrupt 1 parameter is enabled.
RelativeTimer2|Relative Timer 2|Relative Timers||||Relative Timer 2 Note: Useful only when Relative Timer 2 parameter is enabled.
AutoReloadValue2|Auto reload value|Relative Timers||0|4095|Auto reload value 2 (12 bits). This parameter must be a number between 0 and 4095.
CounterMode2|Counter mode|Relative Timers||||Counter Mode 2. Note: Useful only when Counter Mode 2 parameter is enabled.
ReloadInterrupt2|Reload interrupt|Relative Timers||||Reload Interrupt 2. Note: Useful only when Reload Interrupt 2 parameter is enabled.

